        {
          "text": "Lino ibbokesi lya-Jehova lyakakala kuŋanda ya-Obedi-Edomu mu-Giti myezi yotatwe, nkabela Jehova wakamupa coolwe Obedi-Edomu abasiluzubo bakwe boonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
