        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mwami Davida wakaambilwa kuti, Jehova wabapa coolwe basinanda ba-Obedi-Edomu aboonse mbajisi nkaambo kabbokesi lya-Leza, Mpawo Davida wakaya kuyoogwisya ibbokesi lya-Leza kuŋanda ya-ObediEdomu akulileta kumunzi wa-Davida cakusekelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
