        },
        {
          "text": "Mpuwo ibbokesi lya-Jehova nilyakasika buyo kumunzi wa-Davida, Mikala mwana musimbi wa-Saulo wakasondela acipulo, nkabela naakabona mwami Davida ulasotoka akuzyana kubusyu bwa-Jehova, wakamusampaula mumoyo wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.6.16"
            ]
          }
