        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi wakaabila bantu boonse, nkukuti imbungano yoonse yaba-Israyeli, nibaba baalumi nibaba banakazi, umwi umwi caabilo cacinkwa acituli can yama acibunge camicelo iiyanikidwe, Elyo bantu boonse bakapambukana umwi aumwi kuŋanda yakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
