        {
          "text": "Mpawo Davida wakaboola kuzoolongezya basiŋanda bakwe. Nkabela Mikala mwana musimbi wa-Saulo wakeza kuzoocinga Davida, wakati, Ma! Weebeka sunu mwami wa-Israyeli naakalivumbula kumeso aabasimbi babalanda bakwe mbubonya mbubalivumbula basikambotwembotwe! ",
