        {
          "text": "Lino Davida wakaambila Mikala kuti, Ndakali kubusyu bwaJehova, nguwe iwakandisala kwiinda uso abasiluzubonyina boonse, kuti andibike mbuli mweendelezi wabantu ba-Jehova, Nzoosekelela kubusyu bwa-Jehova. ",
